WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.420
All these years, I thought
you didn't like me.

2
00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.050
Well, you never made it easy.

3
00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:18.030
You were always too busy competing with me.

4
00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:19.440
What can I say?

5
00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.380
I had to get your attention somehow.

6
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:23.120
You were always looking at Owen.

7
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.510
Oh, please.

8
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.920
You just couldn't stand the thought of losing to Owen,
even when it came to me.

9
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.490
Didn't know early attendance
came with a kissing bonus?

10
00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.200
How did you get in?

11
00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.700
Well, my mother-in-law just
got back from a business trip.

12
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:46.760
She let me in.

13
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:49.960
Funny.

14
00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:52.890
You never told Raymond what happened
when we shared a room that night.

15
00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:57.500
Nothing happened.

16
00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:01.980
Did it?

17
00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.030
Not when you're like this.

18
00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.470
Then stay.

19
00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:16.000
I like you, but I don't
know how to tell you.

20
00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:17.710
I can see that.

21
00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:28.320
I'm just saying, I got to
sleep next to him first.

22
00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:32.510
You make it sound like
you won a billion dollars.

23
00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.160
Didn't I?

24
00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:53.980
I received your letter.
